window.products.push({"id":131136,"name":"Terra Hiker Ice Maker for Countertop, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Minutes, 28.7 lbs Ice in 24 Hours, No Water Line and Drain Line Required, Home Ice Machin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dd7j2dcKL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAST ICE-MAKING: Built with a powerful 120 W compressor, this ice maker can produce 9 ice cubes in as little as 6 minutes. It generates ice cubes for over 100 cold drinks with a maximum daily production of 28.7 lb. Note: A newly installed appliance may take time to produce ice cubes effectively. It should produce ice cubes normally after several cycles. 2 ICE CUBE SIZES TO MEET YOUR NEEDS: Smaller ice cubes are crisp, crunchy, and won’t stick together, making them the best choice for people who enjoy chewing ice. The larger-sized ice cubes are extremely hard and won’t melt quickly, making them the ideal choice for cooling your drinks. USER-FRIENDLY INTERFACE & EASY OPERATION: Functional buttons with LED indicators allow for easy operation. Just add water, turn on the machine, and wait for the ice. This ice maker will inform you of its status with notifications like “Ice Full” or “Add Water”. It’s built with a high-density polyurethane foam layer for excellent insulation and heat blocking, allowing your ice cubes to be stored for up to 6-8 hours. CARRY HANDLE: A carry handle is attached to the ice maker, making it convenient to move wherever it needs to go. This ice maker is suitable for apartments, dorms and RVs. ENERGY-EFFECTIVE AND NEAR-SILENT: This ice maker features an R600a/0.8 oz refrigerant to enable fast cooling while only consuming 1 kWh of electricity per 10 hours, 40% less than other ordinary ice makers. A built-in spoiler effectively reduces noise to a whispering 43 dB, allowing you to enjoy company and conversation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dd7j2dcKL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Terra Hiker","source_asin":"B092DCXQRR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DCXQRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092DCXQRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
