window.products.push({"id":131346,"name":"jaalee Wireless Temperature/Humidity/Dewpoint/VPD Smart Sensor Thermometer/Hygrometer Data Logger Export Monitor Greenhouse Grower Refrigerator Freeze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kmbw360LL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"When the Android phone can't connect the Bluetooth thermometer, try the following: 1. Restart the Bluetooth phone. 2. Turn on the \"position information or GPS\" switch of the mobile phone (Android mobile phone includes low-power Bluetooth in the GPS position switch of the mobile phone, and the position switch also needs to be turned on when receiving the data of the temperature and humidity meter). 3. If you still can't add it successfully, please restart the phone. Free Data Storage And Export：You can view hour/day/week/month/year data as needed, allowing you to view historical temperature and humidity records at any time. The graph display provides you with a clear data change track. You can export the data to CSV format for use. Use just the sensor and your phone via Bluetooth or add a Gateway (This link does not include the gateway. You need to buy a separate gateway to utilize alarm features at other links.) for data and alerts via the Internet. With the Gateway and Cloud, get updates anywhere and push notifications when conditions exceed min/max alarm settings. jaalee Wireless Temperature/Humidity/Dewpoint/VPD Smart Sensor Thermometer/Hygrometer Data Logger Export Monitor Greenhouse Grower Refrigerator Freezer Fridge Accurate Reading：It provides extremely accurate readings within the accuracy range of ±0.3°C and ±3%RH deviation. Help you obtain accurate and reliable data. -40℃-60℃ measurement range, you can manually calibrate to make the equipment data more accurate. The Bluetooth thermometer and hygrometer can be used alone. The open distance is 100m, the blocking distance is reduced, the data is recorded once a minute, and the data can be stored for 20 days. The data can be viewed in the mobile phone, Excel can be exported, and PDF can be sent to the computer by mobile phone (the mobile phone does not need to be kept with the thermometer all the time)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kmbw360LL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAALEE","source_asin":"B08KFTGQV8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KFTGQV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KFTGQV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":131347,"name":"Gui's Chicken Coop Egg Tray - Rustic Wooden Egg Holder For Eggs Usable in Kitchen Refrigerator, or Countertop for Display or Storage - Easy to Clean… ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iYof+92DL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Do you want that vintage farmhouse feel for your pantry, kitchen island, table, or even fridge? Crystal is too breakable. Stoneware too heavy. Metal isn't appropriate. Plastic is too cheap. The logical choice is our high quality wooden egg tray holders. They are not stackable since there is no lid, but with 18 slots for eggs, you probably have more than enough for your storage needs. If you are the type who puts your deviled egg platter with its eggs on the side, length wise, you would not be able to use these, but if you put them in the other way you absolutely could use this as a deviled egg tray or part of your rustic kitchen decor. It also doubles as a chocolate, or cheese ball / balls display! Many who want something a little fancier go for things like ceramic egg trays, which do look nice. But who wants something that is so breakable? Go with this acacia wood egg container so that you can have a rustic or farmhouse look to your kitchen. If you are one who celebrates Easter, this also is a great Easter egg holder or display","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iYof+92DL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUI'S CHICKEN COOP","source_asin":"B08L3JZ5XF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L3JZ5XF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L3JZ5XF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
