window.products.push({"id":131391,"name":"UPGRADED 285976 8182233 Drum Baffle by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirlpool Ken-more Washing Machine - Pack of 3 - Replaces AP3769371 8181669","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FmPYiNgAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝐃𝐈𝐒𝐏𝐄𝐋 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐂𝐄𝐑𝐍𝐒-𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝐑𝐄𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐍 & 𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐄. Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.We sincerely serve you. ✦【𝐈𝐃𝐄𝐀𝐋 𝐑𝐄𝐏𝐋𝐀𝐂𝐄𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓】--The 285976 8182233 drum baffle lifts and tumbles is located in the washing machine drum and fixed on the drum wall at equal intervals. It is used to push the clothes to rotate when the washing machine is rotating, so that the clothes can produce friction, so that the clothes can be washed more clean. It is approximately 11.2 inches long x 2.38 inches wide x 2.64 inches high.The package includes 3 drum baffles. ✦【𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐁𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐃 𝐍𝐄𝐖 𝐀𝐍𝐃 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘】--The 285976 Washer Drum Baffle is made from high quality materials and rigorously manufactured to ensure a long service life. All the products received are brand new and unopened.If baffle is broken, the washer will have the following conditions, and the baffle need to be replaced in time: ★The old baffle cracked; ★There is a gap between the baffle and the drum. ✦【𝐃𝐈𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐋𝐘 𝐅𝐈𝐓 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐖𝐀𝐒𝐇𝐄𝐑】--The 285976 Front Load Washer Drum Baffle can fits for Ken-more, Kitchen-Aid, Whirl-pool washer.★285976 REPLACE NUMBER: PD00002695,8181669,8182225,AP3769371,1058883,AH970109, EA970109, PS970109.▶FIT MODELS:11042822203, 11042824200, 11042924200, 11042822200,KHWS01PMT2, GHW9400PW2, GHW9400PW0, GHW9400PW1, GHW9400PW3.𝐌𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐢𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧.If you're unsure about the compatibility, send us your dryer model number and we can help you confirm if it fits or not. ✦【𝐁𝐑𝐈𝐍𝐆 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐈𝐄𝐍𝐂𝐄 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐋𝐈𝐅𝐄】--The installation of 285976 Washer Drum Baffle is simple. Before making repairs, disconnect the power and water, put on your work gloves. You need to use a screwdriver to remove the screws holding the baffle in place, then push the baffle back a little bit, after which you can remove the old baffle. Align the new baffle with the position, push it forward to clamp into the position, and then fix it with screws.You can follow the Youtube videos if you have trouble installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FmPYiNgAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0881LWLZV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0881LWLZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0881LWLZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
