window.products.push({"id":131724,"name":"Camplux JK-7700 Portable Gas Stove, 11,500 BTU Aluminum Alloy Butane Stove, Single Burner Outdoor Camping Stove with Carrying Case, CSA Listed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cAhejBeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"✅ CSA SAFETY CERTIFICATION, SAFETY DEVICE- Camplux JK-7700 butane stove passed CSA (US & Canadian Standards Association) safety certification,which provides security for your outdoor cooking.This portable butane stove has built-in canister ejection system, which will eject butane fuel canister if irregular flow/pressure is detected. Automatic safety shut off device: shuts off gas flow when irregular flow/pressure is detected.No need to worry about safety problem of this portable butane stove. ✅ 11,500 BTU HIGH EFFICIENCY- Camplux JK-7000 butane camp stove has an output of 11,500 BTU from its cast aluminum burner, making it more powerful than most products in the market. And you can easily adjust heat through the stove’s control knob. This butane burner use standard 8oz butane canister.Fast heat up in 3 seconds,no need to wait too long,you can enjoy delicious food in a short time.This camping stove will definitely save you a lot of time. ✅ LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE- Camplux single burner butane stove is made of lightweight gold-colored aluminum alloy,which gave it a thin body.JK-7700 portable butane stove weighs only 3.1lb,and coming with a convenient clear carrying case, you can carry it to anywhere.Ideal for camping, outdoor cooking, BBQ, backpacking, RV travel,fishing,hiking or as a back up emergency stove, easy to solve the daily cooking problem. ✅ EASY TO USE, EASY TO CLEAN- For your safety, please install and use under the instruction of the manual.The portable gas stove built in a piezo auto ignition feature,no need to use traditional matches or lighters. Built-in round stainless wind shield to prevent the flame from being blown out by wind. Lock the gas canister position and turn the control knob to the end with a click noice. Easy to use, and suitable for any outdoor settings.Easy to clean up aluminum surface and dripping tray. ✅ CONSIDERATE CUSTOMER SERVICE- Here at Camplux, customer service is everything! We offer 24 shift hours customer service make the customer experience easy and fast through our live chat, phone support & our online helpdesk. Have a question? Give us a call at (844) 538-7475.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cAhejBeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAMPLUX ENJOY OUTDOOR LIFE","source_asin":"B07FN82QBG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FN82QBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FN82QBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
