window.products.push({"id":131762,"name":"ICEPURE ADQ747935 Replacement for LG LT1000P Kenmore Elite 9980 MDJ64844601 LT1000, LT1000PC, ADQ74793501 LMXS28626S, LMXS30796S LMXC23796S, LFXC22526","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811xyDJxsxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️𝐀𝐮𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐂𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬‒ ICEPURE RWF4700AB replacement for LG LT1000P refrigerator water filter bears major Authoritative Certifications on markets, such as NSF/ANSI 42 & 372 Lead-Free from IAPMO, European Food Grade Regulations EC-1935/2016, ROHS, REACH, BPA-Free, TUV and Australian Water Mark. For higher filtering levels (NSF/ANSI 401 certified), please search for ASIN:B09MF3R5QD ❄️𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐅𝐢𝐥𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐂𝐚𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐢𝐭𝐲‒ ICEPURE RWF4700AB refrigerator water filter replacement for LG ADQ747935 and Kenmore Elite 9980 reduces many harmful substances from your water including 99% of Chlorine, taste, odor, THM, VOCs, Particles and all other major impurities, significantly improving the taste of drinking water to provide pure-tasting water, while retaining minerals beneficial to the human body. ❄️𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐮𝐦 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐬‒ BPA-free and food-grade materials. This filter is made from advanced natural coconut shell carbon and is Certified by Authoritative organizations for Safe Material. The Outer layer is 0.5 Micron, ensuring better filtration. The carbon blocks have been independently tested by a third-party laboratory to remove heavy metals, large sediments, and all other dangerous impurities and contaminants. ❄️𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬‒ ICEPURE Refrigerator Water Filter, Compatible with lg refrigerator water filter model: LG LT1000P, LT1000PC, LT1000PCS, LT-1000PC, ADQ74793501, MDJ64844601; Kenmore 46-9980, 9980, ADQ74793502; This filter is not the original product. Compatible Air Filter Models: LG LT120F, ADQ73214402, ADQ73214403, ADQ73214404, ADQ73334008, 46-9918, 469918, 9918. The filter is not an original product. ICEPURE is an independent brand. ❄️𝐆𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐭 𝐯𝐚𝐥𝐮𝐞 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐦𝐨𝐧𝐞𝐲‒ ICEPURE filters are made with Premium materials, Efficient Filtration, Authoritative Certifications and advanced technologies. ❄️𝐇𝐢𝐠𝐡 𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐬‒ ICEPURE water filters use US technology and teams. The ICEPURE brand has high requirements for products, and every product that is manufactured must go through 5 inspection and testing stages，ensuring that every product meets our high expectations. ❄️𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐤‐𝐟𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧‒ ICEPURE filters use advanced and precise measurement technology, combined with 3D multi-dimensional design technology to ensure that our products fully match the original products and do not leak water. ❄️𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐝 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐟𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥 ‒ ICEPURE is a professional brand that is committed to the water treatment industry. For the past 20 years, Our products have been sold all over the world, and countless families have used or products as their solution. ❄️𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐭𝐨 𝐑𝐞𝐩𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐞‒ This filter can easily be installed without tools. For optimum performance we recommended that you change your filter every 6 months or 200 gallons, whichever comes first, this will vary based on your water quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811xyDJxsxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B07QHWWYR9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QHWWYR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QHWWYR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
