window.products.push({"id":131982,"name":"pp-Code LoRa Temperature, Humidity and Pressure Sensor, Monitor from Anywhere with Email Alerts (Long Range Technology)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DwwWTZ5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Refer to https://Watchman.Online for details] This variation of Watchman product uses LoRa technology and can cover a longer range (up to 1km/0.6miles) compared to WiFi Watchman (typically deployed with in 75ft of access point). It does require a LoRa gateway that you can buy/lease from us or bring your own (please check our website for details). LoRa gateway connects (using Ethernet or WiFi) to your existing router. LoRa Watchman, listed here, offers temperature, humidity and pressure logs. You can also be (email) alerted for changes in temperature, humidity and pressure readings (per your alert configuration settings on pp-Code portal). You will have access to logs, 6-day history, daily emails with log snapshot and alerts (up to 3 email receivers). There is no subscription required per LoRa Watchman, however you will need monthly subscription ($4.99) per LoRa gateway (a single LoRa gateway can support as many as 25 LoRa Watchman units). You can monitor all watchman under one account or split them as you need. The pp-Code portal will also allow you at add additional users for monitoring (such as site managers). LoRa Watchman is good fit (operationally as well as financially) for monitoring multi-tenant buildings, farming and agricultural sites as well as large storage, warehouses and construction sites. A comparable WiFi based solution (especially if to be newly installed to enable monitoring) will have a higher total cost and may require professional installation. Watchman comes with our best-in-class support. Our customers are our representatives and we serve each support email with our full dedication. Product comes with 90 day warranty and we offer life time support regardless of the warranty period.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DwwWTZ5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pp-Code WM","source_asin":"B073NR5J9P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-131982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073NR5J9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B073NR5J9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
